  "description": "DAPDEF crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C116 H174 Co4 N2 O46 P6 Tb6. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Tb1B (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2B (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3B (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Co1B (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Co2B (Co) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 15 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.179-4.112 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.44-126.95°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [CoII4TbIII6(O3PCH2Ph)6(O2C tBu)14(MeCN)2].",
